This game my have it flaws but by all means get it when it is on sale.

Pro:
Great Graphics: flora, lighting, textures; 
a sh*t ton of things to do;
lots of costumisation;

cons:
become a bit drawn out;
mechanicaly unresponsive world: your actions dont effect the world

All in all its a good game for people who just want to throw on a podcast and blow some stuff up.

